    {
      "id": "0179a0b0-0274-4456-aa33-c6fcc9b6c018",
      "name": "AI Competitor Analyzer",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "position": [
        2624,
        1568
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "text": "=Analyze the following competitor website and generate a comprehensive competitive intelligence report.\n\nCompetitor Name:\n{{ $json.data.metadata.title.split(\"|\")[0].trim() }}\n\nWebsite:\n{{ $json.data.metadata.sourceURL || $json.data.metadata.url }}\nWebsite Content:\n{{ $json.data.markdown }}\n\nYour objective is to identify the competitor's business strategy, market positioning, marketing approach, customer acquisition strategy, strengths, weaknesses, and opportunities.\n\nCarefully evaluate:\n\n1. Executive Summary\nProvide a concise overview of the company and its overall positioning.\n\n2. Company Positioning\nDescribe how the company differentiates itself in the market.\n\n3. Primary Value Proposition\nExplain the main value the company promises to customers.\n\n4. Core Messaging\nIdentify recurring headlines, taglines, messaging themes, and communication style.\n\n5. Products and Services\nList the primary offerings.\n\n6. Target Audience\nIdentify the likely customer segments.\n\n7. Calls-to-Action\nIdentify all important CTAs used across the website.\n\n8. Trust Signals\nIdentify testimonials, certifications, customer logos, statistics, awards, security badges, guarantees, or social proof.\n\n9. Marketing Tone\nDescribe the overall communication style.\n\n10. SEO Observations\nIdentify keyword strategy, content depth, metadata quality, internal linking, and blog/content strategy if observable.\n\n11. Conversion Opportunities\nIdentify weaknesses that could reduce conversions and suggest improvements.\n\n12. Newly Identified Features\nList any recently launched products, AI capabilities, integrations, announcements, or feature releases.\n\n13. Potential Weaknesses\nIdentify gaps in positioning, messaging, UX, content, differentiation, pricing transparency, or trust.\n\n14. Business Insights\nSummarize strategic observations that could impact competitors.\n\n15. Recommended Actions\nProvide prioritized recommendations that another company could implement to compete more effectively.\n\nImportant Instructions:\n\n\u2022 Base every conclusion only on the supplied website content.\n\u2022 Do not invent information.\n\u2022 If information is unavailable, return an empty value.\n\u2022 Focus on actionable insights rather than simple descriptions.\n\u2022 Think like a competitive intelligence consultant preparing an executive report.\n\u2022 Return only structured output using the provided schema.",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a world-class Competitive Intelligence Analyst, Business Strategist, and Digital Marketing Consultant with expertise in SaaS, AI, B2B, B2C, e-commerce, and technology companies.\n\nYour responsibility is to analyze competitor websites and identify meaningful business, marketing, product, and strategic insights that help companies make better business decisions.\n\nYour analysis should be:\n\n\u2022 Objective and evidence-based\n\u2022 Strategic rather than descriptive\n\u2022 Actionable and business-focused\n\u2022 Concise but comprehensive\n\u2022 Free from assumptions that are not supported by the website content\n\nWhen information is unavailable, return an appropriate empty value instead of guessing.\n\nEvaluate the competitor across multiple dimensions including:\n\n\u2022 Company positioning\n\u2022 Value proposition\n\u2022 Brand messaging\n\u2022 Product portfolio\n\u2022 Target audience\n\u2022 Customer pain points addressed\n\u2022 Calls-to-action\n\u2022 Trust signals and credibility\n\u2022 Marketing strategy\n\u2022 Pricing indicators (if available)\n\u2022 Sales strategy\n\u2022 SEO opportunities\n\u2022 Content marketing approach\n\u2022 User experience observations\n\u2022 Conversion optimization opportunities\n\u2022 Competitive strengths\n\u2022 Competitive weaknesses\n\u2022 Recently introduced features or announcements\n\u2022 Strategic risks\n\u2022 Business opportunities\n\u2022 Recommended strategic actions\n\nAlways think like a senior business consultant rather than a website summarizer.\n\nYour recommendations should be practical, prioritized, and suitable for executive decision-making.\n\nReturn structured information only using the schema provided by the Output Parser."
        },
        "promptType": "define",
        "hasOutputParser": true
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.1
    },
